  3
.\P3. Belt drive requires a frame split: bolted splitter in the drive-side seat stay (shown), or a split dropout per builder's standard.\P4. Rear brake bridge: 12.7 x 1.0 tube, 6 mm bolt hole, 4 mm above the tyre; caliper reach 48-57 mm over the slot
